{"problem":{"stackLimit":128,"modifiedUser":"FrankieFly","judgeCaseMode":"default","auth":1,"description":"您正在玩您最喜欢的节奏游戏。您的节拍图布局由 $n$ 行和 $4$ 列组成。由于最下面的音符距离较近，因此您将先处理最下面的一行，最后处理最上面的一行。每一行将包含一个音符，用 \"#\"表示。\n\n对于每个音符 $1, 2, \\dots, n$ ，按照处理顺序，输出该音符所在的列。","source":"","title":"节奏游戏","type":0,"output":"对于每个测试用例，在新行中输出 $n$ 个整数，即从 $1$ 到 $n$ 的所有中 “#” 出现的列 $i$。","ioScore":100,"codeShare":true,"isFileIO":false,"isRemote":false,"timeLimit":1000,"difficulty":0,"input":"第一行包含 $t$ ( $1 \\leq t \\leq 100$ ) - 测试用例数。\n\n对于每个测试用例，第一行包含 $n$ （ $1 \\leq n \\leq 500$ ）--节拍图的行数。\n接下来的 $n$ 行包含 $4$ 个字符。第 $i$ 行代表节拍图从上到下的第 $i$ 行。可以保证这些字符要么是\".\"，要么是 \"#\"，并且其中正好有一个字符是 \"#\"。\n\n保证所有测试案例中 $n$ 的总和不超过 $500$ 。","examples":"<input>3\n4\n#...\n.#..\n..#.\n...#\n2\n.#..\n.#..\n1\n...#\n</input><output>4 3 2 1 \n2 2 \n4 \n</output>","hint":"","isRemoveEndBlank":true,"openCaseResult":true,"memoryLimit":256,"problemId":"Q0010","isGroup":false,"isUploadCase":true,"judgeMode":"default"},"languages":["C","C++","Java","Python3"],"samples":[{"output":"Q00101.out","input":"Q00101.in","score":6},{"output":"Q00102.out","input":"Q00102.in","score":6},{"output":"Q00103.out","input":"Q00103.in","score":6},{"output":"Q00104.out","input":"Q00104.in","score":6},{"output":"Q00105.out","input":"Q00105.in","score":6},{"output":"Q00106.out","input":"Q00106.in","score":7},{"output":"Q00107.out","input":"Q00107.in","score":7},{"output":"Q00108.out","input":"Q00108.in","score":7},{"output":"Q00109.out","input":"Q00109.in","score":7},{"output":"Q001010.out","input":"Q001010.in","score":7},{"output":"Q001011.out","input":"Q001011.in","score":7},{"output":"Q001012.out","input":"Q001012.in","score":7},{"output":"Q001013.out","input":"Q001013.in","score":7},{"output":"Q001014.out","input":"Q001014.in","score":7},{"output":"Q001015.out","input":"Q001015.in","score":7}],"tags":["字符串","数组","模拟"],"codeTemplates":[],"judgeMode":"default"}